WEBVTT

00:02.510 --> 00:05.130
Now, I'll ask you to return...

00:05.780 --> 00:07.780
...what you've taken.

00:11.070 --> 00:12.940
Doom Fist!

00:26.620 --> 00:27.760
It's useless.

00:31.080 --> 00:32.480
What's happening?

00:32.480 --> 00:34.660
My magic won't activate.

00:35.420 --> 00:40.560
Don't tell me... you're inversing my spell?!

00:40.560 --> 00:43.010
That's impossible!

00:44.860 --> 00:48.190
<b></b>Episode 12

00:44.860 --> 00:48.190
<b>  Anti-Mage</b>

00:57.560 --> 00:59.790
I told you it's useless.

01:08.890 --> 01:10.090
Freeze!

01:10.090 --> 01:12.550
If you come any closer, I'll destroy this!

01:12.900 --> 01:14.370
Don't you dare take a step from—

01:14.370 --> 01:16.500
Be my guest.

01:17.100 --> 01:18.240
What?

01:18.240 --> 01:20.590
I'm saying, do whatever the hell you like!

01:28.230 --> 01:31.940
What do you take me for?!

01:35.360 --> 01:36.410
What?!

01:37.770 --> 01:39.870
Gravity Control.

01:40.340 --> 01:41.510
There's no way!

01:41.510 --> 01:45.290
No one can use the magic 
of this Circle at such a speed!

01:46.540 --> 01:48.500
I'll be taking this back.

01:56.020 --> 01:59.810
How are you drawing mana from 
an unprocessed magic gem?!

02:00.720 --> 02:02.390
You don't need to know.

02:10.960 --> 02:12.040
It's over.

02:59.220 --> 03:00.910
You're like a magical beast.

03:01.290 --> 03:02.990
Not "like."

03:02.990 --> 03:05.490
I <i>am</i> a magical beast!

03:33.630 --> 03:35.610
You bastard!

03:38.230 --> 03:39.830
Ow...

03:40.770 --> 03:41.990
It doesn't work on you, huh?

03:41.990 --> 03:43.890
You insolent brat!

04:19.040 --> 04:20.070
How foolish.

04:28.850 --> 04:31.410
A spell of that level won't work on me,

04:32.400 --> 04:36.550
and I can use magic even in this state.

04:39.010 --> 04:42.030
I'll let you choose how you want to die.

04:42.600 --> 04:46.120
By magic, or by fist?!

04:48.050 --> 04:50.690
I won't give you time to inverse!

05:08.590 --> 05:10.080
I'll skewer you.

05:28.420 --> 05:30.520
You're persistent,

05:32.370 --> 05:34.860
but this will be the end of you.

06:18.010 --> 06:21.030
Die!

07:00.980 --> 07:04.690
That's what you get when 
you resist the Outers.

07:18.840 --> 07:20.090
What?

07:26.160 --> 07:27.300
Impossible!

07:28.440 --> 07:30.730
That was a rare spell.

07:30.730 --> 07:33.160
Because of that, it took me a while.

07:37.080 --> 07:38.230
What?

07:38.650 --> 07:41.480
You can inverse this spell, too?!

07:59.540 --> 08:03.000
Damn you, damn you, damn you, damn you!

08:13.280 --> 08:15.220
Fireball!

08:51.810 --> 08:57.840
Who exactly... are you?

09:02.970 --> 09:04.950
<i>I don't know that, either.</i>

09:06.860 --> 09:11.280
<i>But... I know my role.</i>

09:13.060 --> 09:14.050
Desir!

09:14.050 --> 09:15.500
Desir!

09:43.190 --> 09:46.190
Magical Tower Headquarters

09:49.240 --> 09:51.560
Are you sure this is what you wanted?

09:52.000 --> 09:55.100
Your reward for protecting Regernel...

09:55.100 --> 09:56.110
Yes.

09:56.110 --> 09:59.770
I want to play chess against 
the master of the Magical Tower.

10:00.440 --> 10:02.300
You're a strange one.

10:03.100 --> 10:08.460
Though I can say the same thing of 
the master for accepting your request.

10:13.920 --> 10:15.720
This is as far as I go.

10:16.140 --> 10:17.600
Make sure to behave yourself.

10:17.600 --> 10:20.600
Yes, ma'am. Thank you.

10:32.100 --> 10:34.420
Welcome, Desir Herrman.

10:40.420 --> 10:42.850
<i>The master of the Magical 
Tower, Zod Exarion.</i>

10:43.970 --> 10:48.790
<i>Right now, and also in the future, 
he is no doubt the strongest mage there is.</i>

10:50.200 --> 10:55.910
<i>And he's... my irreplaceable friend.</i>

10:59.270 --> 11:00.470
What's the matter?

11:00.470 --> 11:03.480
Oh, it's nothing. I'm just nervous.

11:06.410 --> 11:07.520
Do sit down.

11:07.520 --> 11:08.260
Yes, sir.

11:14.100 --> 11:16.860
Thank you for making time for me.

11:17.430 --> 11:23.000
I wish I could indulge in our game, 
but I have a meeting in 27 minutes.

11:23.500 --> 11:25.540
Do you have a set of rules you prefer?

11:25.540 --> 11:28.880
I would like to request the Irbil method.

11:31.060 --> 11:32.690
An unusual choice.

11:32.690 --> 11:35.670
Not many around here know 
how to play under those rules.

11:49.210 --> 11:51.440
A good friend of mine taught me.

11:52.170 --> 11:54.150
Almost forcibly.

11:55.590 --> 11:57.160
That must have been difficult.

12:01.530 --> 12:03.670
It's a fond memory now.

12:04.900 --> 12:05.980
I see.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.080
Then let us begin.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.300
You are skilled.

12:22.060 --> 12:23.380
Thank you.

12:23.880 --> 12:26.350
But you have more to learn.

12:26.890 --> 12:29.810
Looks like I might make it to the meeting.

12:29.810 --> 12:31.420
Looks that way.

12:31.940 --> 12:34.650
Why don't we make a wager?

12:35.380 --> 12:36.600
Wager?

12:36.600 --> 12:37.620
Yes.

12:38.420 --> 12:41.220
A loser will grant one wish of a winner.

12:41.220 --> 12:42.450
What do you say?

12:42.950 --> 12:44.650
That wouldn't work.

12:45.020 --> 12:49.220
There is no way that you, 
a student, can grant my wish.

12:53.630 --> 12:55.510
Those haven't been 
processed yet, am I right?

12:55.510 --> 12:56.900
May I borrow one?

12:56.900 --> 12:57.920
You may.

13:19.250 --> 13:20.070
Let me see it!

13:21.340 --> 13:22.410
Here you go.

13:25.970 --> 13:28.400
<i>Even though it's unprocessed...</i>

13:30.000 --> 13:31.790
What exactly did you do?

13:32.800 --> 13:36.180
Why don't we make that answer my wager?

13:39.460 --> 13:40.480
Very well.

13:40.860 --> 13:43.010
If I win, you will tell me how.

13:43.970 --> 13:46.510
And... what is your wish?

13:47.700 --> 13:49.980
I'll tell you when I win.

13:50.520 --> 13:51.980
Interesting.

13:52.660 --> 13:54.500
Then the wager is set.

13:58.800 --> 14:00.370
I'll give it everything I've got.

14:03.660 --> 14:07.160
Fergman's Villa

14:23.550 --> 14:27.350
Why don't you help work the crowd?

14:29.350 --> 14:36.100
Unpleasant rumors are going around 
because you lost in the ranking tournament.

14:36.940 --> 14:38.200
I'm not interested.

14:38.570 --> 14:40.530
What did you say?

14:40.530 --> 14:42.590
It's true that we lost.

14:43.010 --> 14:45.740
It's pointless to hide it or lie about it.

14:45.740 --> 14:49.680
You should have beat Desir and his team!

14:49.680 --> 14:51.330
It's all your fault!

14:51.330 --> 14:53.140
Do you understand that?!

14:54.450 --> 14:57.420
If you have complaints, 
then leave here right now!

14:57.420 --> 15:00.610
And quit my Blue Moon while you're at it!

15:13.280 --> 15:14.480
Not a bad idea.

15:34.810 --> 15:37.870
Hey, doesn't this remind you of someone?

15:37.870 --> 15:39.690
How irritating he is.

15:39.690 --> 15:40.960
It's so cute, isn't it?!

15:40.960 --> 15:41.850
Huh?

15:42.420 --> 15:43.390
Huh?

15:43.880 --> 15:44.810
Huh?

15:45.340 --> 15:46.220
Huh?

15:46.800 --> 15:47.760
Huh?

15:48.450 --> 15:49.260
Huh?

15:49.970 --> 15:50.760
Huh?

15:51.350 --> 15:52.110
Huh?

15:52.470 --> 15:56.260
Now, you two did really 
well against the Outers.

15:56.650 --> 15:59.740
Thanks to you, 
we recovered the Tear of Regernel.

16:00.740 --> 16:02.990
Of course we did!

16:03.380 --> 16:06.070
Do you think I'd really say that?

16:08.500 --> 16:13.790
Honestly, neither Pram nor I had 
any chance against the last guy.

16:15.840 --> 16:17.710
We need to get stronger.

16:17.710 --> 16:19.250
That's what you're getting at, right?

16:19.660 --> 16:20.450
Right.

16:21.680 --> 16:22.670
Excuse me?

16:23.300 --> 16:24.310
What's up?

16:24.880 --> 16:30.340
Why do you try so hard 
to train us to be strong?

16:34.420 --> 16:38.650
In 13 days, a Shadow World will appear.

16:38.650 --> 16:41.310
We'll be sent to conquer it.

16:42.850 --> 16:45.690
It won't be like the simulations 
we do at the Academy.

16:46.730 --> 16:50.290
If we fail, then the world will 
get closer to its doom, and...

16:51.060 --> 16:52.460
We will die.

16:54.440 --> 16:56.950
I will not allow that to happen.

16:57.310 --> 16:58.790
I won't let anyone die.

16:59.290 --> 17:01.110
No matter what I have to do!

17:05.310 --> 17:08.970
Knowing you, I'm sure 
that will come true, as well.

17:10.970 --> 17:15.580
Even though you're in the lowest Circle, 
you're somehow super strong.

17:15.580 --> 17:20.980
And you were right about 
the Privius Clocktower and the Outers.

17:21.500 --> 17:23.940
Seriously, who exactly are you?

17:31.810 --> 17:32.860
I'm...

17:33.170 --> 17:35.120
Stop!

17:35.600 --> 17:36.330
Huh?

17:36.730 --> 17:38.210
You don't need to say it.

17:38.790 --> 17:40.540
I thought you wanted to know.

17:41.490 --> 17:42.650
I do.

17:42.650 --> 17:43.730
Then...

17:45.830 --> 17:50.090
Do you remember what I said 
when you invited me to join the party?

17:52.000 --> 17:56.500
I said, "I'm gonna uncover 
your secret, so just you wait!"

17:56.500 --> 17:59.480
So I don't want you to just tell me.

17:59.480 --> 18:00.680
Too bad.

18:01.150 --> 18:02.750
Romantica...

18:05.210 --> 18:06.780
Are you being honest with yourself?

18:06.780 --> 18:08.620
You actually want me to tell you, don't you?

18:08.620 --> 18:10.120
Of course not!

18:10.120 --> 18:11.620
Don't be shy. I'll tell you!

18:11.620 --> 18:12.650
I am actually...

18:12.650 --> 18:14.450
Stop it!

18:15.740 --> 18:17.870
I believe in you, Desir!

18:18.290 --> 18:19.580
Thank you.

18:19.580 --> 18:22.120
That's all you say, Pram.

18:28.970 --> 18:33.030
We all need to get stronger... including me.

18:33.730 --> 18:36.140
I'm sure it will be tough, 
but please stick with me.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.600
Okay!

18:37.600 --> 18:39.590
I guess I'll have to.

18:53.990 --> 19:00.830
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

19:03.470 --> 19:10.250
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

19:10.250 --> 19:12.840
<i>A stolen smile</i>

19:12.840 --> 19:22.260
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

19:22.260 --> 19:26.810
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

19:26.810 --> 19:31.180
<i>For the final challenge</i>

19:31.180 --> 19:34.610
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

19:34.610 --> 19:40.790
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

19:40.790 --> 19:44.120
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

19:44.120 --> 19:51.250
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

19:51.250 --> 19:53.550
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

19:53.550 --> 19:56.180
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

19:56.180 --> 20:00.930
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

20:00.930 --> 20:03.290
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

20:03.290 --> 20:06.010
<i>To my own story</i>

20:20.630 --> 20:22.040
I'll be in your care.

20:24.790 --> 20:27.540
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

20:27.540 --> 20:30.250
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

20:30.250 --> 20:33.860
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

20:38.340 --> 20:43.750
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

20:43.750 --> 20:48.350
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

20:49.100 --> 20:54.470
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

20:54.470 --> 20:58.900
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

20:59.250 --> 21:05.420
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

21:05.420 --> 21:10.680
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

21:10.680 --> 21:15.710
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

21:15.710 --> 21:19.920
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

21:21.430 --> 21:24.200
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:24.200 --> 21:26.890
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:26.890 --> 21:30.400
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:32.270 --> 21:35.110
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

21:35.110 --> 21:37.690
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

21:37.690 --> 21:40.400
<i>Because this time</i>

21:40.400 --> 21:44.530
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

21:54.000 --> 21:58.000
13 Days Later

21:59.100 --> 22:01.920
<i>This is an emergency 
announcement for all students.</i>

22:01.920 --> 22:03.970
<i>This is not a drill.</i>

22:03.970 --> 22:07.890
<i>Today, we've confirmed 
that a Shadow World has appeared.</i>

22:08.680 --> 22:12.390
<i>All students must immediately 
report to the auditorium.</i>

22:12.800 --> 22:13.850
<i>I repeat.</i>

22:13.850 --> 22:16.360
<i>This is an emergency 
announcement for all students.</i>

22:16.740 --> 22:18.800
<i>This is not a drill.</i>

22:19.140 --> 22:22.980
<i>Today, we've confirmed that 
a Shadow World has appeared.</i>

22:22.980 --> 22:26.530
<i>All students must immediately 
report to the auditorium.</i>

22:27.480 --> 22:29.780
So this is the combat uniform...

22:29.780 --> 22:31.370
Hmm, it's not bad!

22:31.370 --> 22:32.600
I know!

22:33.310 --> 22:35.270
You two look great!

22:54.420 --> 22:56.070
I know.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.990
We need her, right?

22:58.430 --> 22:59.430
Yes.

23:05.820 --> 23:07.130
<i>It starts right here.</i>

23:09.500 --> 23:11.830
<i>The reason why I was brought back here...</i>

23:12.440 --> 23:13.860
<i>My role...</i>

23:16.400 --> 23:18.030
<i>This time, I will...</i>

23:19.590 --> 23:20.500
<i>We will...</i>

23:23.460 --> 23:25.430
Shall we begin?

23:25.430 --> 23:26.880
Okay!

23:27.200 --> 23:28.340
Yes!

23:28.790 --> 23:29.800
Sure.

23:35.860 --> 23:38.120
<i>We will save the world!</i>
